Why this patch is needed
------------------------
On a Mac, OpenSceneGraph reads png, jpeg, tga and the other common picture formats with its ImageIO plugin
(Apple's picture decoder) and maps those file extensions to it. The desktop OpenGL build of the engine
(the dependency set from the openmw-deps project) reads them with the plugins that use libpng and libjpeg instead.
The engine's own list of packaged plugins (USED_OSG_PLUGINS in the root CMakeLists.txt) also names the
png, jpeg and tga plugins and not ImageIO.

So that both builds decode every picture with the same code, and so that the Metal build links no Apple picture
library, this patch makes a Mac build find libpng and libjpeg, drops the extension aliases that point at ImageIO and
stops building the ImageIO plugin. It is the same change the openmw-deps project makes for its Mac build (its patch
named macos-dedicated-image-plugin), written again here.

diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
index a03a9e2..2735c24 100644
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -832,6 +832,8 @@ IF(NOT (ANDROID AND OSG_FIND_3RD_PARTY_DEPS))
         ENDIF()
 
     ELSE()
+        FIND_PACKAGE(JPEG)
+        FIND_PACKAGE(PNG)
         FIND_PACKAGE(TIFF)
         FIND_PACKAGE(QuickTime)
         FIND_PACKAGE(QTKit)
diff --git a/src/osgDB/Registry.cpp b/src/osgDB/Registry.cpp
index c47439b..5b73a82 100644
--- a/src/osgDB/Registry.cpp
+++ b/src/osgDB/Registry.cpp
@@ -320,19 +320,6 @@ Registry::Registry()
 
     addFileExtensionAlias("js", "V8");
 
-#if defined(DARWIN_IMAGEIO)
-    addFileExtensionAlias("jpg",  "imageio");
-    addFileExtensionAlias("jpe",  "imageio");
-    addFileExtensionAlias("jpeg", "imageio");
-    addFileExtensionAlias("tif",  "imageio");
-    addFileExtensionAlias("tiff", "imageio");
-    addFileExtensionAlias("gif",  "imageio");
-    addFileExtensionAlias("png",  "imageio");
-    addFileExtensionAlias("psd",  "imageio");
-    addFileExtensionAlias("tga",  "imageio");
-
-#endif
-
 #if defined(USE_QTKIT)
     addFileExtensionAlias("mov",  "QTKit");
     addFileExtensionAlias("mp4",  "QTKit");
diff --git a/src/osgPlugins/CMakeLists.txt b/src/osgPlugins/CMakeLists.txt
index 15afe51..5a77512 100644
--- a/src/osgPlugins/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/src/osgPlugins/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -225,10 +225,6 @@ ENDIF()
 #    ADD_SUBDIRECTORY(OpenAL)
 # ENDIF()
 
-IF(APPLE AND NOT ANDROID)
-    ADD_PLUGIN_DIRECTORY(imageio)
-ENDIF()
-
 IF(AV_FOUNDATION_FOUND)
     ADD_PLUGIN_DIRECTORY(avfoundation)
 ENDIF()
